B.13: New Purchase Type Flag Count


- New_Purchase_Type_Flag_Count:
  SELECT COUNT(*)
  FROM dual
  WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1
                FROM det_trades dt, transaction_types tt
                WHERE dt.trxn_type = tt.trxn_type
                  AND tt.load_id <> 'BONUS'
                  AND dt.folio_no = Input.Folio_Number
                UNION ALL
                SELECT 1
                FROM det_trades_history dth, transaction_types tt
                WHERE dth.trxn_type = tt.trxn_type
                  AND tt.load_id <> 'BONUS'
                  AND dth.folio_no = Input.Folio_Number);


