B.26: SO NAV Queries


- SO_NAV_Primary:
  SELECT nvl(nav, 0)
  FROM nav_master
  WHERE nav_date = SO_Trade_Date
    AND scheme_code = SO_Scheme_Code
    AND nav_serial = Input.NAV_Serial_No;

- SO_NAV_Fallback:
  Use function: get_nav_value(SO_Scheme_Code, SO_Trade_Date);

- SO_Units_DET:
  SELECT nvl(SUM(nvl(units, 0)), 0)
  FROM (SELECT nvl(SUM(plot_units), 0) units
        FROM det_trades d
        WHERE folio_no = Input.Folio_Number
          AND scheme_code = SO_Scheme_Code
          AND trunc(entry_date) = trunc(Input.Entry_Date)
          AND source_program NOT LIKE CASE
                WHEN INC_TRIG_TRXN_FOR_AGGRE_LIMIT = 'N' THEN 'Investrak%'
                ELSE '!@#$%^'
              END
          AND trxn_type IN (SELECT trxn_type
                           FROM transaction_types
                           WHERE trxn_sign = '+'
                             AND trxn_db_cr IN (SELECT *
                                               FROM TABLE(itn_plf_in_list(AGGREG_TRXN_DB_CR_FOR_LIMIT))))
        UNION ALL
        SELECT nvl(SUM(plot_units), 0) units
        FROM det_trades_deleted
        WHERE folio_no = Input.Folio_Number
          AND scheme_code = SO_Scheme_Code
          AND trunc(entry_date) = trunc(Input.Entry_Date)
          AND source_program NOT LIKE CASE
                WHEN INC_TRIG_TRXN_FOR_AGGRE_LIMIT = 'N' THEN 'Investrak%'
                ELSE '!@#$%^'
              END
          AND trxn_type IN (SELECT trxn_type
                           FROM transaction_types
                           WHERE trxn_sign = '+'
                             AND trxn_db_cr IN (SELECT *
                                               FROM TABLE(itn_plf_in_list(AGGREG_TRXN_DB_CR_FOR_LIMIT))))
          AND redeemed_flag = 'X');


B.27: Purchase Amount Aggregation - Entry Date Based


- SUM_Purchase_Amount_CDT_Entry_Date:
  SELECT nvl(SUM(amount), 0)
  FROM consolidated_daily_trades
  WHERE folio_no = Input.Folio_Number
    AND scheme_code = Input.Scheme_Code
