1.20: Hierarchical Limit Fetching (plp_schfundsfund_trxn_limit Logic)


This section implements the complete hierarchical limit fetching logic
with 5 priority levels: Insurance → Systematic History → Systematic Current
→ Scheme History/Current → Sub-fund → Fund

-- Priority 1: Insurance limits (AMC='B'/'F' with insurance_id)
IF (Input.Insurance_ID IS NOT NULL
    AND AMC_Code IN ('B', 'F')
    AND REC_INSURANCE_LIMIT IS NOT NULL) {

